OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining cloud and rain soon
OL,7,Fclearing. A dry and mostly clear night
OL,8,Fto follow with the wind easing to a
OL,9,Flight breeze. Feeling chilly in
OL,10,Fplaces, with fog patches and grass
OL,11,Ffrost likely in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny fog soon clearing to leave
OL,14,Fa fine day with light winds and long
OL,15,Fsunny spells, the sunshine may turn
OL,16,Fhazy at times. Feeling warm in any
OL,17,Fafternoon sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
