OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain Tuesday morning, warm
OL,7,Fnight to follow. Heavy rain followed
OL,8,Fby a clearer evening on Wednesday. Dry
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells on Thursday.
OL,10,FTemperatures remaining mostly above
OL,11,Faverage.
